  "source_question": {
    "predicate": "whether the registered 2006 UGA ADM2 Bukonjo/Busongora source features are applicable to the 2019 COD ADM2 Oïcha source as territorial exclusions for these exact original cells",
    "unresolved_finding": "The retained UBOS 2006 county polygons intersect the registered Bukonjo feature across UBOS BUKONJO (823.245 km²; 80.5083%) and BUSONGORA (186.829 km²; 18.2708%); the registered Busongora feature overlaps UBOS BUSONGORA by 2,107.620 km² (95.3493%) and smaller amounts across seven other UBOS counties. This is aggregate full-polygon source comparison, not per-key target-cell membership, source lineage, political adjudication, or proof that the 2006 source applies to 2019 COD cells.",
    "key_split": "32 Bukonjo/Bukonzo candidate keys and one Busongora candidate key, derived from the pinned original matrix; name concordance is not treated as positive qualification.",
    "remaining_question": "Whether the provenance/applicability of the 2006 UGA feature representations can be resolved against the 2019 COD Oïcha target. Official EC and UBOS sources confirm relevant administrative names/subdivisions but do not provide a digital source-feature lineage crosswalk."
  },
